  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_8101.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>102 fotos del dia de Sant Blai, divendres 3 de febrer, amb exposicions i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_8199.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>triple premi de fotografia per a Paco Piquer Moliner en el concurs Suera, un poble al carrer organitzat pel Centre Cultural, i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/IMG_8430.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>40 fotos del bou de la Quinta, &#39;Capit&aacute;n&#39;, de la ramaderia Germans Guillam&oacute;n, dissabte de vesprada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8085.jpg\" alt=\"img_8085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8087.jpg\" alt=\"img_8087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8088.jpg\" alt=\"img_8088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8089.jpg\" alt=\"img_8089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8090.jpg\" alt=\"img_8090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8091.jpg\" alt=\"img_8091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santblaiquintossuera17/img_8092.jpg\" alt=\"img_8092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"h